W("Discuss what you would do in any two of the situations given in the lesson (fire in the kitchen, a child choking, an electrical appliance sparking, a bicycle knocking down a pedestrian). Use about 80 words.", 4, "Fire: switch off the gas, cover the pan with a lid or wet cloth, keep away children, call for help. Electrical appliance sparking: switch it off at the mains with dry hands or a dry stick, unplug it, do not touch with wet hands, call an electrician. (Any two with correct steps; 2 each.)", "H", wp=True),
